---

<header class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <h1>multiverse<span>ctl</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">Run your whole multi-repository system several times at once, on one machine. Each run gets its own branch, its own containers, its own data and its own hostnames &mdash; so several people, or several agents, can work different branches at the same time without taking turns.</p>
      <p class="cta">
        <a class="btn btn-1" href="/start/install.html">Install</a>
        <a class="btn btn-2" href="/docs.html">Docs</a>
        <a class="plain" href="https://github.com/cristiansteib/multiversectl"><svg class="ghmark" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 .297c-6.63 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.303 3.438 9.8 8.205 11.385.6.113.82-.258.82-.577 0-.285-.01-1.04-.015-2.04-3.338.724-4.042-1.61-4.042-1.61C4.422 18.07 3.633 17.7 3.633 17.7c-1.087-.744.084-.729.084-.729 1.205.084 1.838 1.236 1.838 1.236 1.07 1.835 2.809 1.305 3.495.998.108-.776.417-1.305.76-1.605-2.665-.3-5.466-1.332-5.466-5.93 0-1.31.465-2.38 1.235-3.22-.135-.303-.54-1.523.105-3.176 0 0 1.005-.322 3.3 1.23.96-.267 1.98-.399 3-.405 1.02.006 2.04.138 3 .405 2.28-1.552 3.285-1.23 3.285-1.23.645 1.653.24 2.873.12 3.176.765.84 1.23 1.91 1.23 3.22 0 4.61-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.92.42.36.81 1.096.81 2.22 0 1.606-.015 2.896-.015 3.286 0 .315.21.69.825.57C20.565 22.092 24 17.592 24 12.297c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12"/></svg>GitHub</a>
      </p>
      <p class="fineprint">Apache 2.0. One binary for Linux and macOS, no daemon of its own.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="term">
      <div class="term-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>two universes, one machine</span></div>
<pre><span class="pr">$</span> multiversectl universe ls
<span class="u">universe 1</span><span class="d">  ·  acme-u1  ·  </span><span class="g">5 running</span>
<span class="rule"></span><span class="d">APP  BRANCH      URL</span>
api  <span class="u">feat/login</span>  <span class="a">http://api-u1.10-0-0-5.traefik.me</span>
