<span class="u">universe 2</span><span class="d">  ·  acme-u2  ·  </span><span class="g">5 running</span>
<span class="rule"></span><span class="d">APP  BRANCH      URL</span>
api  <span class="u">main</span>        <span class="a">http://api-u2.10-0-0-5.traefik.me</span>
